Spec: Human in the Loop

Purpose:
  Define the human review and approval gates in the
  prompt-to-code pipeline. Ensures human oversight at critical points.

Gates:
  GATE-1: Prompt to Docs
    Trigger: AI generates docs from prompt
    Action: Human reviews generated docs
    Decision: Approve / Request Changes / Reject
    Output: approved docs/ or revision feedback

  GATE-2: Docs to SDD
    Trigger: AI generates .sdd/project/ from docs
    Action: Human reviews .sdd/project/
    Decision: Approve / Request Changes / Reject
    Output: approved .sdd/project/ or revision feedback

  GATE-3: SDD to Code
    Trigger: AI executes chains based on .sdd/project/
    Action: Human reviews generated code
    Decision: Approve / Request Changes / Reject
    Output: approved code/ or revision feedback

  GATE-4: Code to Production
    Trigger: AI prepares deployment
    Action: Human reviews deployment plan
    Decision: Approve / Request Changes / Reject
    Output: deployed system or revision feedback

ApprovalMatrix:
  docs_changes:
    - architectural_changes: HUMAN_APPROVAL
    - tech_stack_changes: HUMAN_APPROVAL
    - requirements_changes: HUMAN_APPROVAL

  sdd_changes:
    - structural_changes: HUMAN_APPROVAL
    - dependency_changes: HUMAN_APPROVAL
    - policy_changes: HUMAN_APPROVAL

  code_changes:
    - new_feature: AUTO (review after)
    - refactor: AUTO (review after)
    - security_fix: HUMAN_APPROVAL

  deployment:
    - staging: AUTO
    - production: HUMAN_APPROVAL

Rules:
  [H1] Human MUST approve docs before .sdd/project/ generation.
  [H2] Human MUST approve .sdd/project/ before code execution.
  [H3] Human MUST approve production deployment.
  [H4] All approvals MUST be recorded in audit log.
  [H5] Rejected proposals MUST include revision feedback.
  [H6] AI MUST NOT skip human gates.
  [H7] Human feedback MUST be incorporated before proceeding.
  [H8] Approval MUST be scoped (what, when, expires).

State: +
